/si.imgix.net/aa31721f/uploads/origins/34b6b7c4-56d6-46a0-a447-ae36cc3fe6b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0a8bda0643c3529916072e4296352922 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gomaru_Art/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4340a843/uploads/origins/bb8f7294-95cb-4354-a684-c6dfde4ed93b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=250951eb42a9092a134c6f8c472d900d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4340a843/uploads/origins/bb8f7294-95cb-4354-a684-c6dfde4ed93b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=250951eb42a9092a134c6f8c472d900d, https://si.imgix.net/4340a843/uploads/origins/bb8f7294-95cb-4354-a684-c6dfde4ed93b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7adc63ae84619dc5a5a5342175de1e35 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4340a843/uploads/origins/bb8f7294-95cb-4354-a684-c6dfde4ed93b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c89f2fb3501b7fa228740544f653781 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは、また来ました。ガンダムビルドファイターズトライの星野ふみな(https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gundam/images/f/f0/Figure-Rise_Standard-Fumina_Hoshino.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20201014023540)をボクシングの試合で見てみたいと思っています。衣装は写真のものから黄色のジャケット（つまりブラとスパッツ）とピンクと白のボクシンググローブ（https://sanabulsports.com/products/womens-easter-egg-boxing-gloves）を除いたものです。ポーズは、床に倒れていて、体と顔にあざがあり、口からは血と唾が出ています（https://www.deviantart.com/mastersaruwatari/art/KO-d-Tiffany-for-my-birthday-By-Azasket-844495938）。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gomaru_Art/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/26074364/uploads/origins/b33efd76-3909-43f7-bdfc-cad38b2df121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6386bc83125aca44e84c2e9f9b436bc2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/26074364/uploads/origins/b33efd76-3909-43f7-bdfc-cad38b2df121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6386bc83125aca44e84c2e9f9b436bc2, https://si.imgix.net/26074364/uploads/origins/b33efd76-3909-43f7-bdfc-cad38b2df121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=891d6485f8c646ddafa6a3ce2f2cc4b8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/26074364/uploads/origins/b33efd76-3909-43f7-bdfc-cad38b2df121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9ddef783ea1c8fe8f46612ecf71eefe 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。\n\n私のオリジナルキャラクター「ナタリア」の絵を描いてほしいのですが。\n\nナタリアの参考資料\nhttps://i.imgur.com/QxQkwah.png\n\nこんな感じでプロレスの衣装を着ています。\nhttps://i.imgur.com/GBTrI41.jpg\n\n背景はプロレスのリングでしょう。\n\nあとはあなたにお任せします。\n\nありがとうございました。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gomaru_Art/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d8cf90d3/uploads/origins/9c75843c-1cf7-4f36-9090-5deae304d9a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d0ae2bcb9732e8a404ec723446db907", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d8cf90d3/uploads/origins/9c75843c-1cf7-4f36-9090-5deae304d9a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d0ae2bcb9732e8a404ec723446db907, https://si.imgix.net/d8cf90d3/uploads/origins/9c75843c-1cf7-4f36-9090-5deae304d9a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cf817e33a892f6a72d4ba3e3300d712d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d8cf90d3/uploads/origins/9c75843c-1cf7-4f36-9090-5deae304d9a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39011d2a2c6a46e0b25145a28f9e959a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hi! I saw what you did for my friend 20BBoy. I would like you to do Ann Takamaki from Persona 5 knocked out cold as she is wearing a boxing outfit I made for her. Here is the outfit-> https://www.deviantart.com/mastersaruwatari/art/Boxer-Ann-Takamaki-by-SensouSanka-833653963\n\nHow I want her to be knocked out with overhead view of her.-> https://sta.sh/0152rzesgfem", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gomaru_Art/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/37cbfe97/uploads/origins/b20085fc-230b-42c4-b2ca-06efd0d118a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0e6a191b7075d26deed4d402ddf9900", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/37cbfe97/uploads/origins/b20085fc-230b-42c4-b2ca-06efd0d118a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0e6a191b7075d26deed4d402ddf9900, https://si.imgix.net/37cbfe97/uploads/origins/b20085fc-230b-42c4-b2ca-06efd0d118a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d6c6ac6a9c2647d26541466cfa8dff72 2x, https://si.imgix.net/37cbfe97/uploads/origins/b20085fc-230b-42c4-b2ca-06efd0d118a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a3638e120c8ddf235704223aac04802e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、リクエストをしてもいいですか？詳細は以下の通りです。\nキャラクターフィットネス・ボクシングのソフィー（ https://giantbomb1.cbsistatic.com/uploads/scale_small/16/164924/3243275-sophie.png ）。\n服装これ＋ボクシンググローブ(https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oepFtr_pkMc/maxresdefault.jpg)\nポーズビーチで対戦相手を待つポージング\nその他彼女の詳細については、こちら（https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Ew75lGnVIAIyPOs?format=png&name=large）を参照してください。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}